    "evidence_text": "The Short Life of Jos\u00e9 Antonio Gutierrez\n\nGothika\n\n The film was first released on November 21, 2003 in the United States.\n\nSebastian Gutierrez\n\nSebastian Gutierrez (born September 10, 1974) is a Venezuelan film director, screenwriter and film producer.\n\nRise: Blood Hunter\n\nThe Alzheimer Case\n\n An American remake of the film is in development at Focus Features.\n\n Stephane Sperry is the producer.\n\n Matthew Michaud adapted the screenplay from the original film.\n\nJudas Kiss (1998 film)\n\n It was directed by Sebastian Gutierrez.\n\nShe Creature\n\n It is the first in a series of films made for Cinemax paying tribute to the films of American International Pictures.\n\nElektra Luxx\n\n The film is a sequel to the ensemble comedy, \"Women in Trouble\".\n\nHotel Noir\n\nHotel Noir is a 2012 crime film directed and written by Sebastian Gutierrez.\n\n The film stars Carla Gugino and Rufus Sewell.\n\nThe Eye (2008 film)\n\n It is a remake of the Pang Brothers' 2002 film of the same name.",
